Z||000005||StuGood||10-17-2000||06:20 PM||||I wasn't suggesting that the ECM itself was bad - hopefully just a bad connection that supplies juice to the ECM.  The following link might prove helpful:  <BR> <A HREF="http://www.euronet.nl/users/fo_elmo/techno.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.euronet.nl/users/fo_elmo/techno.htm</A> <P>Good luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||4
Z||000006||sdm1964||10-17-2000||07:13 PM||||I have a computer that i will sell you for 25.00 it is from an 87 GT just have to replace the prom chip in it.Take the one out of your car and put it in this one. Let me know.||||reg||14
Z||000007||ka4nkf||10-17-2000||08:38 PM||||If the check engine light does not come on when you turn the ignition on then It sounds like the ECM is not getting power to the code section. anytime the check engine light wont come on when the ignition is turned on then the bulb is burned out or It Is not getting any power. on the 84 there Is a power disconnect for the ECM. It Is located under the Intake manifold right above the distributor. It is a weatherproof single wire. It Is hard to find but you will see It If you look real close. make sure the connection is good. good luck||||reg||1
Z||000008||ka4nkf||10-17-2000||08:38 PM||||If the check engine light does not come on when you turn the ignition on then It sounds like the ECM is not getting power to the code section. anytime the check engine light wont come on when the ignition is turned on then the bulb is burned out or It Is not getting any power. on the 84 there Is a power disconnect for the ECM. It Is located under the Intake manifold right above the distributor. It is a weatherproof single wire. It Is hard to find but you will see It If you look real close. make sure the connection is good. good luck||||reg||1
Z||000009||ka4nkf||10-17-2000||08:52 PM||||I dont know why It made the double post. just one rule of thumb to look at, anytime the check engine light does not come on when you turn the ign. switch on then the engine will not run, it has lost its power providing the bulb is good. for those who have the V6 the ECM disconnect Is by the battery,in the wiring harness. one red wire sticking out of the harness with a quick disconnect.||||reg||1
